    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3ec003-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-128-5p.s34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">《Zhèng Hé》, page 82)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-128-6h.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Note:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3h.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Dānshā</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3p.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">tastes sweet,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3p.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">slightly cold,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3p.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">and is non-toxic.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3p.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">It primarily treats various illnesses of the five viscera and the entire body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3p.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">nourishes the spirit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3p.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">pacifies the soul,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3p.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">benefits Qi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-3p.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">sharpens the vision,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-4p.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">clears the blood vessels,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-4p.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">alleviates restlessness and fullness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-4p.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">quenches thirst,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-4p.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">boosts vitality,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-4p.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">brightens the complexion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-4p.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">kills demonic spirits and malevolent ghosts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-4p.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">eliminates sudden illnesses,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">abdominal pain,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">toxic Qi,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">scabies and sores,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">and various skin lesions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Prolonged use allows one to reach divine understanding, prevent aging,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">lighten the body, and become a celestial being.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">It can transform into mercury.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">When ground into powder, it is called Zhēnzhū (cinnabar).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-5p.s24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">The color and luster are like mica,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-6p.s25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">and the kind that can be cleaved is good.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-6p.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">It grows in the mountains and valleys of Fúlíng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-6p.s27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Harvesting is not restricted to a specific time.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-6p.s28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">It dislikes magnet stone</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-6p.s29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">and is weakened by saltwater.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-6p.s30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-7p.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Based on the fact that it can be transformed into mercury and is called Zhēnzhū,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-7p.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">it is what is now called Zhūshā (cinnabar).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-7p.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Doctors of the present erroneously use realgar and orpiment from Wǔdū and Chóuchí,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-7p.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">and call it Dānshā.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-7p.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Practitioners of medicine often use these interchangeably,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-8p.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">but this is incorrect.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-8p.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Fúlíng is Fú Prefecture,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-8p.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">which borders the south of Ba Commandery.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-8p.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">It is no longer harvested there.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-8p.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">Instead, it comes from Wǔlíng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-8p.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">and among the various Yi tribes of Western Sichuan.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3ec003_Shang_006-129-8p.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T11:06:07.467+09:00">All these areas fall within the territory of Ba.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
